WEBVTT

00:00:02.537 --> 00:00:05.669
The day they spent together in Lakewood

00:00:06.069 --> 00:00:09.808
became an unforgettable memory
for Candy and Anthony.

00:00:11.538 --> 00:00:19.694
However...
Aunt Elroy awaited for their return.

00:00:21.219 --> 00:00:25.496
My Anthony.

00:00:30.661 --> 00:00:34.268
Did you have a good time
riding those wooden horses, Candy?

00:00:35.249 --> 00:00:39.790
It was wonderful. Aunt, would
you like to ride them one day?

00:00:40.185 --> 00:00:41.490
Be quiet!

00:00:42.084 --> 00:00:46.152
A girl from high society doesn't
participate in such primitive amusement!

00:00:46.153 --> 00:00:50.055
Primitive? But Aunt, I'm sure
you would like it.

00:00:50.162 --> 00:00:52.576
Anthony? And what did you do?

00:00:52.776 --> 00:00:56.745
You were seen eating bread with
your bare hands while standing!

00:00:56.953 --> 00:00:58.653
Ahh, a hot dog!

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:00.536
Hot dog?

00:01:00.726 --> 00:01:04.644
You eat them standing up, and they
are very tasty! Right, Candy?

00:01:05.812 --> 00:01:06.499
Yes...

00:01:06.715 --> 00:01:07.618
That's enough!

00:01:07.968 --> 00:01:12.160
Didn't you climb a bell tower in
the church after that?

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:16.016
But... how come everybody
knows about this?

00:01:16.127 --> 00:01:19.044
Townspeople were very curious
about you two.

00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:22.802
They're some pretty nosy people!

00:01:22.837 --> 00:01:23.617
Enough!

00:01:23.861 --> 00:01:24.585
Do you understand?

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:30.108
Members of our Adley family are drawing
a lot of attention from the society.

00:01:30.565 --> 00:01:33.588
The last thing we need is behavior
that would harm our reputation.

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:37.382
You two are the only ones that have
ever inflicted shame upon our family.

00:01:37.417 --> 00:01:38.047
Candy!

00:01:38.262 --> 00:01:39.232
Yes.

00:01:39.415 --> 00:01:41.007
Think twice before you act out.

00:01:41.062 --> 00:01:41.642
Yes.

00:01:42.146 --> 00:01:44.102
Anthony, you'll have to be careful as well...

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.050
-What's the matter?
-Anthony?

00:01:47.771 --> 00:01:48.996
My head hurts a bit.

00:01:49.161 --> 00:01:51.161
Please return to your room
and get some rest.

00:01:51.196 --> 00:01:52.866
I'll call Dorothy.

00:01:55.619 --> 00:01:59.437
We'll give you a water-filled pillow,
Dorothy, will you help me?

00:01:59.472 --> 00:01:59.996
Yes!

00:02:03.921 --> 00:02:07.462
It's my fault, too.
Anthony did it for me...

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:11.130
Miss Candy, you don't need to worry!
He doesn't have a fever!

00:02:11.975 --> 00:02:14.441
-Candy!
-Yes?

00:02:16.013 --> 00:02:17.742
Don't get up!

00:02:18.048 --> 00:02:19.099
I was faking it.

00:02:19.326 --> 00:02:20.291
Faking?

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:23.565
Then, you were lying to Aunt?

00:02:23.953 --> 00:02:28.032
If I hadn't fallen sick, there
would be no end to Aunt's preachings!

00:02:28.266 --> 00:02:30.116
Anthony, you rascal!

00:02:30.212 --> 00:02:34.388
You know, it was hard for me
to see you being scolded there.

00:02:34.423 --> 00:02:36.456
Oh, I'm already used to it!

00:02:37.573 --> 00:02:42.024
Aunt doesn't know the real you!
That's why they see you as their enemy.

00:02:42.059 --> 00:02:43.890
But what can I do?

00:02:44.463 --> 00:02:45.799
Aunt isn't the only one!

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:48.982
Neil and Eliza don't know you as well!

00:02:49.209 --> 00:02:53.264
But instead, it was you who got to know
the real me! That's enough for me!

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:03.088
I wish my mama were alive.

00:03:03.342 --> 00:03:05.093
Your mother?

00:03:05.813 --> 00:03:09.939
I'm sure that my mama would've
become a good friend of yours.

00:03:10.349 --> 00:03:13.211
She was a gentle person, I'm sure.

00:03:15.659 --> 00:03:17.016
She loved roses.

00:03:28.505 --> 00:03:29.254
Mama!

00:03:30.448 --> 00:03:31.323
Mama!

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:37.672
Whenever mama wasn't around, I would look
in the rose garden. And I would find her there.

00:03:38.307 --> 00:03:40.206
But then, one day...
-Mama!

00:03:41.499 --> 00:03:47.879
Seeing those scattering rose petals, I realized that
mama could be going to a faraway place.

00:03:48.753 --> 00:03:49.645
Mama?

00:03:52.577 --> 00:03:54.477
What's the matter, Anthony?

00:03:55.511 --> 00:03:56.877
Mama!

00:03:58.618 --> 00:04:03.997
-Why are you crying...?
-The roses are dying.

00:04:04.389 --> 00:04:07.561
Anthony, flowers are beautiful
because they die.

00:04:07.596 --> 00:04:11.839
And when flowers die, they become immortal
as their petals scatter in the wind.

00:04:14.742 --> 00:04:16.237
They don't die.

00:04:16.938 --> 00:04:18.276
Mama, you won't die?

00:04:22.208 --> 00:04:28.500
If your mama dies, she will forever
continue living inside your heart.

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:44.817
And not too long after that, mama died.

00:04:48.229 --> 00:04:52.371
I finally understood what
she was trying to say.

00:04:52.406 --> 00:04:56.107
...That your gentle mother now
lives inside your heart, right?

00:04:57.466 --> 00:05:01.961
Yes. Mama from those times
will live forever with me.

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:04.406
And that's why you like roses?

00:05:05.216 --> 00:05:10.107
I'm growing roses, just like she used to,
and these roses I'm growing now...

00:05:10.558 --> 00:05:11.200
Candy,

00:05:11.313 --> 00:05:11.937
Yes?

00:05:12.983 --> 00:05:16.181
-If I happen to die...
-No, no, please don't say that!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.582
It's a figure of speech!

00:05:25.672 --> 00:05:27.224
Anthony!

00:05:32.725 --> 00:05:34.704
What a nightmare.

00:06:06.587 --> 00:06:08.484
Why are so many flowers dying?

00:06:14.827 --> 00:06:15.994
Sweet Candy is...

00:06:26.630 --> 00:06:27.919
At that fortune telling...

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:29.801
...only bad cards came up.

00:06:47.906 --> 00:06:50.829
And you didn't get any sleep?

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:53.292
Bad things just keep coming
one after another!

00:06:53.992 --> 00:06:57.735
God wouldn't bring misfortune
to someone like Candy!

00:06:58.311 --> 00:07:01.879
That's right! I forgot to pray!

00:07:03.146 --> 00:07:08.303
But I wonder will God listen to me?
I wasn't always serious in my prayers...

00:07:08.417 --> 00:07:14.201
You know, today the cook gave up the coffee
she likes, because she wished for something.

00:07:14.299 --> 00:07:15.463
Coffee?

00:07:15.845 --> 00:07:19.299
Give up on something you like,
and then you can pray for something!

00:07:19.512 --> 00:07:24.719
That's right. I'll stop my unpleasant
thoughts with God's help.

00:07:25.681 --> 00:07:30.177
Dorothy, for Anthony's sake, I'll give up
on eating pies which I like so much!

00:07:30.267 --> 00:07:33.588
-And I'll give up on ham and eggs.
-Dorothy, you too?

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:36.690
Yes! It's for you, miss Candy.

00:07:37.108 --> 00:07:39.697
Dorothy, thanks.

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:42.811
Kurin!

00:07:46.472 --> 00:07:49.359
Kurin, you still get to eat whatever you want!

00:07:50.839 --> 00:07:53.834
-Come quickly then, breakfast will be served soon.
-Okay.

00:07:59.977 --> 00:08:02.545
-Good morning, Stear!
-Hello, Candy!

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.597
-What are you building?
-What, this?

00:08:04.795 --> 00:08:06.664
I'm preparing for the fox hunt.

00:08:06.923 --> 00:08:07.975
Fox hunt?

00:08:08.542 --> 00:08:12.056
You didn't know?
Entire family gathers and shoots stuff.

00:08:12.131 --> 00:08:13.903
That's pretty sick.

00:08:14.519 --> 00:08:17.544
Everybody... like, every member
of the Adley family?

00:08:17.722 --> 00:08:20.531
That's right. Candy, you too.

00:08:21.007 --> 00:08:21.967
Me too?

00:08:22.158 --> 00:08:25.291
Probably, they will introduce you
to the rest of the family at that time.

00:08:25.949 --> 00:08:27.500
What am I going to do?

00:08:27.741 --> 00:08:30.569
-Just be your normal self!
-Anthony!

00:08:30.829 --> 00:08:34.035
Anthony, what do you think of my new machine?

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:37.770
It's okay. Anyway, building it
must have been easy for someone like you!

00:08:38.377 --> 00:08:40.899
Anyhow, look at this. I'll try it out now.

00:08:40.958 --> 00:08:44.725
You see, if I do this, it will
immobilize the fox with gas...

00:08:45.124 --> 00:08:46.993
Huh? This is strange.

00:08:56.093 --> 00:08:57.213
I'm sleepy...

00:08:57.348 --> 00:09:00.498
I told you, Stear!
You always do these things!

00:09:08.685 --> 00:09:10.031
Hey, everyone!

00:09:11.893 --> 00:09:13.868
Aunt Elroy is calling you!

00:09:14.807 --> 00:09:16.026
She is going to preach again?

00:09:16.061 --> 00:09:18.106
She said it's some kind of emergency.

00:09:18.615 --> 00:09:19.825
Anyway, come inside.

00:09:20.362 --> 00:09:21.915
Alright, let's go.

00:09:24.225 --> 00:09:26.036
Hey, I smell a pie!

00:09:27.913 --> 00:09:30.860
This is the first time she
directly called us for some pie!

00:09:31.003 --> 00:09:35.120
It's the first time in ten years
that I made something in the kitchen!

00:09:36.396 --> 00:09:38.479
It would be a shame just to eat it!

00:09:38.984 --> 00:09:40.955
Everyone, enjoy!

00:09:41.499 --> 00:09:42.377
Let's eat!

00:09:46.845 --> 00:09:47.999
It's great!

00:09:56.151 --> 00:10:00.545
-Candy, what's the matter?
-Don't you want to eat?

00:10:00.925 --> 00:10:04.516
Candy, what happened?
I thought you liked pie!

00:10:05.457 --> 00:10:06.432
It's just...

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:10.026
Candy, have some pie! It's really tasty.

00:10:10.105 --> 00:10:12.975
Are you saying that you don't want
to eat the pie I made myself?

00:10:13.091 --> 00:10:14.188
I'm not saying that!

00:10:18.378 --> 00:10:20.039
Is there some other reason?

00:10:20.625 --> 00:10:22.650
No, it's...

00:10:24.489 --> 00:10:27.200
You're still mad at me
for scolding you last night?

00:10:27.235 --> 00:10:28.565
That's not true!

00:10:29.085 --> 00:10:32.595
-Dorothy! Take away Candy's plate!
-Yes!

00:10:34.045 --> 00:10:35.170
Uh, I...

00:10:36.905 --> 00:10:38.683
If you don't want to eat,
I'm fine with that!

00:10:39.318 --> 00:10:40.947
Grand Aunt!

00:10:48.921 --> 00:10:51.869
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
This is a free fansub!
Do not sell or rent!

00:10:58.123 --> 00:11:03.358
Candy, you can tell me everything.
Why didn't you want to eat the pie?

00:11:03.992 --> 00:11:08.723
I talked to everybody about this...
We wondererd why did Aunt make those pies.

00:11:08.941 --> 00:11:13.566
Aunt was being mean to you from the beginning,
but her opinion on you has been changing.

00:11:13.867 --> 00:11:18.813
That pie... it was from all of us, Candy...
She made it for you.

00:11:19.417 --> 00:11:20.698
For me?

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:25.951
I think that Aunt is sorry
for scolding you yesterday.

00:11:27.029 --> 00:11:28.124
Anthony...

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:34.643
To refuse a token of my friendship...!

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:38.202
Enter!

00:11:43.973 --> 00:11:44.729
Dorothy?

00:11:44.764 --> 00:11:48.486
You don't have any chores in this place.
I have a butler for that.

00:11:48.899 --> 00:11:51.353
Madam, it's my fault.

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:53.103
What are you talking about?

00:11:53.483 --> 00:11:56.293
...that Candy didn't eat the pie.

00:11:57.559 --> 00:11:59.478
You came to tell me that?

00:11:59.874 --> 00:12:01.075
Yes!

00:12:02.865 --> 00:12:04.225
Anthony!

00:12:05.156 --> 00:12:10.122
Sorry, but it's just not like you!
When did you become so religious?

00:12:10.157 --> 00:12:11.052
But...

00:12:11.087 --> 00:12:11.761
Look over there!

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:14.176
It's the time of the year
when roses die.

00:12:14.619 --> 00:12:16.870
They die every year,
but then they bloom again.

00:12:16.905 --> 00:12:20.897
By the way, that fortune telling doesn't
worry me at all.

00:12:21.611 --> 00:12:25.764
I believe happiness is something
a man has to grasp with his own hands.

00:12:25.949 --> 00:12:28.159
A trump card doesn't matter at all!

00:12:29.352 --> 00:12:31.720
Yeah, I think that too!

00:12:31.868 --> 00:12:33.412
Now that's the real Candy!

00:12:33.447 --> 00:12:36.713
-Suddenly I feel hungry!
-Let's eat some pie!

00:12:48.424 --> 00:12:49.195
Aunt!

00:12:53.045 --> 00:12:55.709
Candy, Dorothy told me.

00:12:55.886 --> 00:12:56.868
Im fowwy.

00:12:57.103 --> 00:13:01.106
-You can't speak with food in your mouth!
-Yes.

00:13:01.537 --> 00:13:06.095
You will be introduced to the rest of the
family before the annual fox hunt.

00:13:06.961 --> 00:13:09.163
-I'm glad, Candy.
-Yes.

00:13:09.241 --> 00:13:15.084
In return, I expect you to behave like a
real Adley, without embarrassing yourself.

00:13:15.119 --> 00:13:15.846
Yes!

00:13:16.796 --> 00:13:17.401
Candy.

00:13:17.402 --> 00:13:17.904
Yes?

00:13:18.625 --> 00:13:20.337
You've got pie on your face.

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:24.035
-Oh no!
-You're a lady, don't pig out!

00:13:55.536 --> 00:13:59.666
So that's the girl who was adopted?
I hear that she has noone of her own.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:02.155
Candy, you look great!

00:14:08.521 --> 00:14:13.298
-I wonder if can she greet them like a lady.
-Can't wait to see that!

00:14:15.915 --> 00:14:23.013
Everyone, meet Candice White, whom whimsical
grandfather William decided to adopt as his daughter!

00:14:23.198 --> 00:14:25.385
Now, Candy, introduce yourself.

00:14:25.575 --> 00:14:26.236
Yes.

00:14:26.767 --> 00:14:31.748
Err, everyone, how do you do?
I'm Candice White.

00:14:32.536 --> 00:14:37.432
And, uh... my dream is to
become a beautiful bride and...

00:14:42.909 --> 00:14:45.805
-I'm shocked.
-That's supposed to be an introduction?

00:14:45.913 --> 00:14:49.094
Uh... no, but before that, I thought
I'd have to become a pretty lady and...

00:14:49.095 --> 00:14:51.539
...but I don't really know anything yet,

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:54.716
...I'm working hard,
so please teach me everyhing!

00:15:01.603 --> 00:15:03.615
That was a wonderful introduction, Candy!

00:15:04.227 --> 00:15:07.645
I was so scared, I have no idea what
I said back there!

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:12.482
You startled everybody... telling everybody
about how you want to become Anthony's bride...

00:15:12.517 --> 00:15:14.328
I really said that?

00:15:15.386 --> 00:15:17.135
Stear is kidding you!

00:15:19.227 --> 00:15:20.256
Candy!

00:15:21.287 --> 00:15:23.629
Anthony, want to come with me?

00:15:23.826 --> 00:15:26.791
I'm sorry, but I'll escort Candy.

00:15:27.249 --> 00:15:30.454
It's the first time she's on a fox hunt,
so I'll have to teach her everything.

00:15:31.486 --> 00:15:35.686
I see. Candy, be careful not to fall
off the horse!

00:15:36.265 --> 00:15:40.630
Eliza, take care, too!
Cleopatra doesn't seem to be in a good mood.

00:15:41.261 --> 00:15:41.978
So what!

00:16:02.380 --> 00:16:03.201
Go!

00:16:06.233 --> 00:16:08.332
-Candy, let's go!
-Yeah!

00:16:10.309 --> 00:16:11.420
Archie, let's go!

00:16:36.853 --> 00:16:39.580
Anthony, I think we got separated
from the rest.

00:16:40.002 --> 00:16:41.369
I did that on purpose!

00:16:42.761 --> 00:16:45.529
-There's one hill I like, and it's this way.
-A hill?

00:16:45.617 --> 00:16:46.685
Now, let's go!

00:16:57.057 --> 00:16:58.340
It's here, Candy!

00:17:06.639 --> 00:17:08.085
It's exactly alike...!

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:09.068
Like what?

00:17:09.103 --> 00:17:10.229
Pony's hill!

00:17:14.125 --> 00:17:17.007
I grew up at Pony's hill.

00:17:18.472 --> 00:17:22.046
My homeland is Pony's hill and Pony's home.

00:17:22.947 --> 00:17:24.389
I'd like to see them.

00:17:26.445 --> 00:17:30.201
Because you have so many
memories of that place!

00:17:30.245 --> 00:17:30.924
...yeah.

00:17:31.063 --> 00:17:32.677
Let's go there together!

00:17:33.379 --> 00:17:34.308
Really?

00:17:34.513 --> 00:17:36.670
I want to see the place where you grew up.

00:17:36.879 --> 00:17:37.724
It's a promise!

00:17:37.877 --> 00:17:38.783
It's a promise.

00:17:40.449 --> 00:17:44.202
Sister Pony and sister Lane
will be startled when they see us!

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:49.290
Candy!

00:17:52.681 --> 00:17:53.718
I got something!

00:17:57.937 --> 00:17:59.984
Well, it seems that we're in for a run!

00:18:00.117 --> 00:18:02.721
-Candy, look at me!
-What will you do?

00:18:07.836 --> 00:18:09.353
Candy, look at this!

00:18:31.699 --> 00:18:35.556
-Anthony, that's dangerous!
-Candy, you coward!

00:18:35.591 --> 00:18:37.335
But when you're so high up in the saddle...

00:18:37.552 --> 00:18:39.221
I have confidence in my horse.

00:18:39.573 --> 00:18:41.714
How did it feel?

00:18:41.715 --> 00:18:43.042
It's wonderful!

00:18:43.049 --> 00:18:45.827
I wonder if I could do that!
I'd like to fly like that, too!

00:18:48.724 --> 00:18:50.701
I'd like to fly!

00:18:52.539 --> 00:18:53.433
Candy...

00:18:54.391 --> 00:18:57.544
Whenever my mama would
talk about horses,

00:18:57.579 --> 00:19:00.625
her eyes would light up,
just like yours are now.

00:19:00.854 --> 00:19:02.429
Because she wanted to ride.

00:19:12.825 --> 00:19:13.755
Mother?

00:19:15.754 --> 00:19:18.373
Her body was weak, so doctors made her stop.

00:19:18.578 --> 00:19:21.654
Before dying, she wanted
to ride just one last time.

00:19:22.818 --> 00:19:23.645
Candy?

00:19:25.099 --> 00:19:27.133
About the prince on the hill...

00:19:27.273 --> 00:19:30.254
Anthony, I don't care about him anymore.

00:19:31.464 --> 00:19:33.975
I've already found my prince.

00:19:35.037 --> 00:19:39.069
Anthony, it's you. You're my dear prince.

00:19:40.895 --> 00:19:41.805
Candy?

00:19:54.323 --> 00:19:56.342
I'll say what you just told me now...

00:19:56.377 --> 00:19:59.389
...once we're together at Pony's hill.

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:00.534
Anthony!

00:20:06.987 --> 00:20:11.467
So the prince you met at Pony's hill
looked exactly like me?

00:20:11.502 --> 00:20:12.707
That's right, Anthony!

00:20:13.109 --> 00:20:17.614
I may even know him. When I was little,
there was one boy who loved nature,

00:20:17.649 --> 00:20:19.522
...and he always took care after mama.

00:20:20.124 --> 00:20:21.544
Who was he?

00:20:21.761 --> 00:20:23.277
I'll try to remember!

00:20:26.215 --> 00:20:27.117
Look out!

00:20:54.905 --> 00:20:57.547
Anthony!

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:20.199
To be continued...
